hypertext
{
<tab><cl=F0F010>SYSTEM PANELS<cl=A2A2A2><br><br>
<tab>There are always <cl=FFFFFF>left<cl=B0B0B0> and <cl=FFFFFF>right system panels in the upper corners of the screen<cl=B0B0B0>. If desired, they can be minimized by clicking on the corresponding arrows.<br><br>
<tab><cl=00FF00>Left system panel<cl=B0B0B0>.<br>
<tab>On the left system panel there is a compass (if your character has a mission, the compass indicates the direction of the mission location), <cl=FFFFFF>Health indicators<cl=B0B0B0>, <cl=FFFFFF>Prana<cl=B0B0B0>, as well as buttons for calling windows: <l="hts:\\language\statinfo.hts">Statistics<\l>; <l="hts:\\language\i_charact.hts">Character<\l>; <l="hts:\\language\inventory.hts">Inventory<\l>; <l="hts:\\language\hotkeys.hts">Hotkeys<\l>; <l="hts:\\language\tradechar.hts">Trade (sales)<\l> and the <l="hts:\\language\options.hts">Main menu</l>.<br><br>
<tab><cl=00FF00>The right system panel<cl=B0B0B0>.<br>
<tab>The current date and time in the "Sphere" are indicated on the right system panel (the clock can be converted to electronic form by clicking the left mouse button), as well as call buttons: <l="hts:\\language\map.hts">Maps<\l>; <l="hts:\\language\clan.hts">Clan windows<\l>; <l="hts:\\language\chat.hts">Chat<\l>; <l="hts:\\language\alchemicbook.hts">Recipe Books<\l>; <l="hts:\\language\mantrabook.hts">Mantra Books<\l> and <l="hts:\\language\journal.hts">Magazine<\l>.<br>
}